Package: easyNIS
Title: Reproducible Workflows for the National Inpatient Sample
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Muhammad", "Saad", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "msaadasif.md@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-1792-2357")),
    person("Ali", role = "aut"))
Description: Development tools for reproducible workflows with the Healthcare
    Cost and Utilization Project National Inpatient Sample. Provides an explicit
    year capability roadmap, deterministic invented discharge fixtures, and
    experimental structural import of converted local parquet files.
    Includes experimental single-year survey-design preparation with explicit
    population and domain policies. Annual adapters and approved statistical
    analysis of licensed files remain planned and unvalidated.
